---
layout: layouts/base.njk
full_hero: true
wide: true
description: "The UWA NLP-TLP Group researches natural and technical language processing, building methods and software that read the terse, domain-specific text industry actually writes."
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
  order: 1
---

<section class="lede-section">
	<div class="lede-text">
	<p class="lede">
		We are a research group at The University of Western Australia working on
		<b>natural and technical language processing</b>: how machines read the
		terse, misspelt, jargon-heavy text that industry actually writes, and how
		the knowledge inside it can be given a shape that can be reasoned over.
	</p>
	<p class="lede-support">
		Maintenance work orders, inspection notes, drilling logs and geological
		reports are written under time pressure by domain experts, for domain
		experts. General-purpose language models handle them worst of all. Our
		research runs from annotation and lexical normalisation through entity
		recognition and knowledge graph construction to ontologies and reasoning,
		and we push it out as software that practitioners can use.
	</p>
	</div>
	<figure class="lede-figure">
		<img
			src="/images/photo/team-build-2024-1400.jpg"
			srcset="/images/photo/team-build-2024-700.jpg 700w, /images/photo/team-build-2024-1400.jpg 1400w"
			sizes="(max-width: 992px) 100vw, 42vw"
			width="1400" height="1050"
			alt="Members of the UWA NLP-TLP Group together in 2024">
		<figcaption>The group in 2024.</figcaption>
	</figure>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
	<h2 class="section-heading">What we research</h2>
	<div class="theme-grid">
		{% for theme in themes %}
		<div class="theme-card">
			<h3><a href="/research/{{ theme.slug }}/">{{ theme.name }}</a></h3>
			<p>{{ theme.blurb }}</p>
		</div>
		{% endfor %}
	</div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
	<h2 class="section-heading">What we build</h2>
	<p class="section-intro">
		Every system below came out of the group's research and is running today.
	</p>
	<ul class="project-strip">
		{% for item in collections.software_demos %}
		<li>
			<a href="/projects/#{{ item.data.name | slugify }}">
				<span class="project-strip-name">{{ item.data.name }}</span>
				<span class="project-strip-byline">{{ item.data.byline }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
	</ul>
	<p class="section-more"><a href="/projects/">All projects, with demos and papers</a></p>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
	<h2 class="section-heading">Who we are</h2>
	<p class="section-intro">
		Academics and research students from computer science, linguistics and
		engineering.
	</p>
	<ul class="people-strip">
		{% for item in collections.people_academics | sortByOrder %}
		<li>
			<a href="/people/">
				<span class="people-strip-photo"{% if item.data.image_filename %} style="background-image: url('/images/people/{{ item.data.image_filename }}')"{% endif %}></span>
				<span class="people-strip-name">{{ item.data.name }}</span>
				<span class="people-strip-title">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
		{% for item in collections.people_phd_students | sortByOrder %}
		<li>
			<a href="/people/">
				<span class="people-strip-photo"{% if item.data.image_filename %} style="background-image: url('/images/people/{{ item.data.image_filename }}')"{% endif %}></span>
				<span class="people-strip-name">{{ item.data.name }}</span>
				<span class="people-strip-title">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
	</ul>
	<p class="section-more"><a href="/people/">Everyone, including alumni</a></p>
</section>

<section class="home-section" id="who-we-work-with">
	<h2 class="section-heading">Who we work with</h2>
	<p class="section-intro">
		Our work is done with industry partners and with research groups in
		Australia, Europe, the United Kingdom and the United States.
	</p>
	<ul class="partner-list">
		{% for item in collections.collaborations %}
		<li>
			<a href="{{ item.data.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				<span class="partner-logo"><img src="/images/collaborations/{{ item.data.image_filename }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
				<span class="partner-name">{{ item.data.name }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
	</ul>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-section-quiet">
	<h2 class="section-heading">Join us</h2>
	<p class="section-intro">
		We supervise PhD and honours students across all of the areas above, and
